{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>And you shall clothe them, your brother Aaron.</b> The word אתם includes the woven tunic, the turban, and the sash, which are Aaron's garments; it also includes the tunics that are not woven, the sashes, and the caps, which are his sons' garments." "<b>And you shall consecrate.</b> By speech, like טמא יטמאנו (Leviticus 13:44)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:52.958685140Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}